OL,3,GNEWSABasement flat plans for
OL,4,Aconservation area refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn the basement of a
OL,7,Fproperty in a conservation area in
OL,8,FBradford have been refused on multiple
OL,9,Fgrounds.
OL,11,FThe application for four one-bed flats
OL,12,Fin the basement of 3 to 5 Parkfield
OL,13,FRoad, Manningham, was rejected after
OL,14,FBradford Council found the heritage
OL,15,Fstatement including in the plan
OL,16,Freferred to a different building.
OL,18,FOfficers said the proposals, by Aliya
OL,19,FBahadur provided an "inadequate level
OL,20,Fof amenity" for future residents, with
OL,21,Fnot enough parking and very little
OL,22,Fnatural light in some of the flats.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
