OL,3,GNEWSABasement flat plans for
OL,4,Aconservation area refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservation officers at the authority
OL,7,Fsaid changes to the property, which is
OL,8,Fcurrently divided into separate homes,
OL,9,Fhave already harmed the St Paul's
OL,10,Fconservation area.
